        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Activation:</strong> <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Three Actions\" aria-label=\"Three Actions\">3</span></p><p><em>Your careful shot wounds your target, causing them to leave behind a trail of blood, staggering footprints, or other marks of passage.</em></p><p>Move up to 5 feet and make a ranged weapon attack against the Physical defense of a target. On a hit or a graze, you also make the target your quarry for your Seek Quarry talent.</p>",
            "chat": "<p><strong>Activation:</strong> <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Three Actions\" aria-label=\"Three Actions\">3</span></p><p>Move 5 feet and make a ranged attack. On a hit or a graze, the target becomes your quarry.</p>",
